	(text "ONE GENERAL-PURPOSE CHANNEL: AN ISOLATED DOMAIN WITH ITS OWN SUPPLY, EXCITATION, CONVERTER\nAND ISOLATORS. THE FOUR CHANNELS ARE INSTANCES OF THIS SHEET. ITS RAILS (COM, +/-5 V, +/-2.5 V,\n1.8 V, 24 V) AND THE EXCITATION BUS ARE LOCAL TO THE INSTANCE: NO TWO CHANNELS SHARE A NET.\nREFERENCES: R2301 IS CHANNEL 2, SHEET 3 (EXCITATION), RESISTOR 1"
